	(text "Buffer triggers at 2.3V\n\nCharging Resistor\nC: 0.00001 F\nTime: 0.25sec\nR = t/(-C * ln(1-Vc/Vs))\n	= 0.25 / (-0.00001 * ln(1 - 2.3/5))\n	= 0.25 / (-0.00001 * -0.61618)\n	= 40572Ω ≈ 39K"
